# 白名單模式：預設忽略全部，只放行 telegram-talk 的 bot 自動化檔案
# 確保 secrets（notion\config.js、*.env、multi-model\config.js）、
# 巢狀 repo（shopee-boost、stock-info）、執行期狀態、大型資料夾全部排除
*

# 放行版控目標
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Claude Telegram.bat
!bot-settings.json
!telegram-watchdog.ps1
!telegram-daily-restart.ps1
!bot-health.ps1

# 放行 PAOS 架構文件
!docs/
!docs/**

# 放行 PAOS 原型程式碼（Path A Lite MVP）。逐一放行，避免帶入 node_modules / .env
!prototypes/
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/src/
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/src/**
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/fixtures/
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/fixtures/**
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/package.json
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/package-lock.json
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/tsconfig.json
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/.env.example
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/.gitignore
!prototypes/marketplace-book-mvp/README.md
